00:16:48.529 --> 00:16:50.618
Happy motherfucking
Valentine's Day.


00:16:50.661 --> 00:16:51.836
Looks like love is...


00:16:57.233 --> 00:16:58.887
Marvin Gable.


00:17:00.758 --> 00:17:01.933
Yeah.


00:17:06.155 --> 00:17:08.462
- Who are you?
- That's King, and I'm Otis.


00:17:11.073 --> 00:17:12.596
Yeah, we work with your brother


00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:14.511
and his right-hand
man, Renny Merlo.


00:17:14.555 --> 00:17:19.473
They brought us in after your
little, uh, career change.


00:17:19.516 --> 00:17:23.259
Damn, I thought your ass would
be a little more scarier.


00:17:23.303 --> 00:17:25.870
But look, your place
here, it inspires me.


00:17:25.914 --> 00:17:29.483
If a has-been killer like
yourself can, you know,


00:17:29.526 --> 00:17:32.834
score a sweet little
civilian life like this,


00:17:32.877 --> 00:17:36.229
maybe there's hope for me and O.


00:17:36.272 --> 00:17:38.032
What you think? You
think I got a shot at it?


00:17:39.145 --> 00:17:41.277
Anything's possible.


00:17:41.321 --> 00:17:43.149
- How's your credit?
- My credit? Hmm?


00:17:46.369 --> 00:17:47.979
Ha ha, ha ha.


00:17:48.023 --> 00:17:49.633
- A little funny guy, huh?
- Fun.


00:17:55.161 --> 00:17:56.901
Now, look, you bleeding


00:17:56.945 --> 00:17:58.729
just a little bit too much


00:17:58.773 --> 00:18:00.905
for a motherfucker who
don't know nothing.


00:18:02.516 --> 00:18:04.189
And I think that you've
packed a little too much


00:18:04.213 --> 00:18:05.649
for a guy who
isn't running away.


00:18:05.693 --> 00:18:07.521
- Mm. Where you going, my boy?
- Okay?


00:18:07.564 --> 00:18:09.697
Time to listen, little man.


00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:11.307
- Listen!
- Listen, motherfucker.


00:18:11.351 --> 00:18:13.004
- Yeah.
- Listen.


00:18:13.048 --> 00:18:14.093
Where is Rose?


00:18:14.136 --> 00:18:15.877
I don't know.


00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:17.487
Come on, now.


00:18:17.531 --> 00:18:19.411
You should've just told
us what we need to know.


00:18:19.446 --> 00:18:22.449
Where is Rose, and why
did you not kill her?


00:18:24.799 --> 00:18:26.192
- What are you doing?
- Hmm?


00:18:26.235 --> 00:18:27.691
What are you doing?
I just opened that.


00:18:27.715 --> 00:18:29.673
So what? It's fucking soda.


00:18:29.717 --> 00:18:31.347
You-you trippin'. Fuck,
I thought we could share.


00:18:31.371 --> 00:18:33.721
- C-Could you ask?
- Fuck, O, please forgive me.


00:18:33.764 --> 00:18:35.157
Of course we can share.


00:18:39.074 --> 00:18:40.249
Fuck!


00:18:44.123 --> 00:18:45.341
Fuck that!


00:18:45.385 --> 00:18:46.473
I'm on him.


00:18:47.517 --> 00:18:49.040
I got it. I got it.


00:18:49.084 --> 00:18:50.477
Get your ass over here.


00:18:51.478 --> 00:18:52.783
- Yeah!
- Yeah, come here!


00:18:54.307 --> 00:18:55.743
Damn, O!


00:18:56.787 --> 00:18:58.485
Watch this, watch this.


00:19:00.182 --> 00:19:01.923
Motherfucker!


00:19:01.966 --> 00:19:03.968
- Tag team!
- Ah, no.


00:19:04.012 --> 00:19:05.692
Your turn, your turn,
your turn, your turn.


00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:14.065
Get him, O! Get him, O!


00:19:27.035 --> 00:19:29.733
Fuck! Why?!


00:19:37.785 --> 00:19:39.178
- Come here.
- Fuck him up, O.


00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:45.706
Oh, shit!


00:19:51.668 --> 00:19:53.888
Where you think you're
going? Oh, fuck!


00:19:53.931 --> 00:19:55.237
What the fuck?!


00:19:57.848 --> 00:20:00.242
- Motherfucker!
- Get the fuck in the fridge!


00:20:00.286 --> 00:20:02.026
- Get your ass in there.
- Damn!


00:20:05.465 --> 00:20:06.857
Bye!


00:20:10.644 --> 00:20:12.559
Watch this, O. Watch this, O.


00:20:13.603 --> 00:20:15.388
Shit, I missed!


00:20:20.393 --> 00:20:22.264
Get him, O! Fuck him up!


00:20:22.308 --> 00:20:23.657
Come on, come on.


00:20:26.921 --> 00:20:29.271
Ooh, shit! Oh!


00:20:30.359 --> 00:20:32.100
Okay. Okay.


00:20:53.643 --> 00:20:55.993
Yeah. Don't think you're
so fucking cool now...


00:21:02.565 --> 00:21:05.133
Hey! Where Rose at,
you little fuck?!


00:21:07.353 --> 00:21:09.137
What...


00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:11.095
Hey, that could've
been your head.


00:21:11.139 --> 00:21:12.749
Tell my brother to back off.


00:21:12.793 --> 00:21:14.621
I'm not telling
your brother shit!


00:21:14.664 --> 00:21:16.492
You know what? I'm-a
kill your little ass.


00:21:19.626 --> 00:21:21.062
What the...


00:21:23.369 --> 00:21:25.893
How the fuck can I get this?


00:21:25.936 --> 00:21:27.938
It's really stuck.


00:21:29.984 --> 00:21:33.727
This little motherfucking
spider monkey ninja.


00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:34.902
God!


00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:50.613
Hey, Marv.


00:21:51.614 --> 00:21:53.137
Rose?


00:21:53.181 --> 00:21:54.965
Hey!


00:21:55.009 --> 00:21:56.880
What the fuck is you...


00:22:03.887 --> 00:22:05.498
See you tomorrow.


00:22:44.450 --> 00:22:45.668
Hello?


00:22:46.713 --> 00:22:47.931
Hey.


00:22:49.411 --> 00:22:52.849
Do you happen to have an
appointment with Mr. Gable?


00:23:05.775 --> 00:23:08.038
Mr. Knuckle. I am
not answering that.


00:23:13.435 --> 00:23:16.960
<i>"My blades are quiet,
sharp and clean.</i>


00:23:17.004 --> 00:23:19.702
<i>"They cut through life unseen.</i>


00:23:19.746 --> 00:23:22.401
<i>"No echo follows,
no scream, no cry.</i>


00:23:22.444 --> 00:23:24.838
<i>Just steel and
flesh as I pass by."</i>


00:23:39.896 --> 00:23:41.768
Did you find her?


00:23:41.811 --> 00:23:43.354
Man, we just got the
shit beat out of us.


00:23:43.378 --> 00:23:45.685
- Marvin and Rose got away.
- Fuck!


00:23:49.645 --> 00:23:51.647
This is so fucked up. Seriously.
-Fuck!


00:23:51.691 --> 00:23:53.736
This motherfucker just
a little bit too crazy,


00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:55.564
and me and O ain't
sign up for this shit.


00:23:55.608 --> 00:23:58.045
K-King, listen to me
very carefully. Okay?


00:23:58.088 --> 00:24:01.135
If she is taken alive, she
will tell Knuckles everything,


00:24:01.178 --> 00:24:03.877
that Kippy fixed the books
and I stole the fucking money,


00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:05.444
and we're all dead.


00:24:05.487 --> 00:24:07.010
You guys are idiots.


00:24:07.054 --> 00:24:10.187
I will find Rose myself
and fucking kill her.


00:24:10.231 --> 00:24:12.320
And I'll text you the address


00:24:12.363 --> 00:24:14.453
so you can clean up
what is left of her.


00:24:14.496 --> 00:24:16.150
Okay? Oh.


00:24:16.193 --> 00:24:18.631
And find Kippy, okay?


00:24:18.674 --> 00:24:20.676
I mean, he hasn't been
returning my calls,


00:24:20.720 --> 00:24:22.852
and that bastard
knows everything.


00:24:22.896 --> 00:24:25.725
- And the fucker talks too much.
- All right, man. Fuck.


00:24:27.422 --> 00:24:28.858
You all right, my boy?


00:24:28.902 --> 00:24:30.425
No.


00:25:00.934 --> 00:25:02.849
What am I wearing?


00:25:02.892 --> 00:25:04.851
Hi! You've reached Marvin Gable


00:25:04.894 --> 00:25:06.679
at Frontier Realty.


00:25:06.722 --> 00:25:09.246
So sorry I missed your
call, but leave a message


00:25:09.290 --> 00:25:11.553
and I'll get back to
you as soon as I can.


00:25:11.597 --> 00:25:13.163
I want a home for you.


00:25:14.730 --> 00:25:16.558
Hey. It's...


00:25:17.603 --> 00:25:19.474
It's me. Um...


00:25:21.520 --> 00:25:25.567
There's a dead poet
in your office.


00:25:25.611 --> 00:25:28.483
Maybe you know that.


00:25:28.527 --> 00:25:30.572
Maybe you don't.


00:25:30.616 --> 00:25:32.269
Very funny, Rose.


00:25:42.105 --> 00:25:45.326
I need you to hear
one of his poems.


00:25:45.369 --> 00:25:48.111
It's called...


00:25:48.155 --> 00:25:49.809
"The Dancing Bear."


00:25:52.986 --> 00:25:56.076
"My dancing bear,


00:25:56.119 --> 00:25:59.122
"sometimes prancing bear.


00:25:59.166 --> 00:26:02.604
<i>"So silent, so graceful.</i>


00:26:02.648 --> 00:26:05.389
<i>"Do you have any wisdom for me,</i>


00:26:05.433 --> 00:26:09.393
<i>"as you sway so charmingly</i>


00:26:09.437 --> 00:26:12.092
<i>"inside your cage?</i>


00:26:12.135 --> 00:26:15.922
<i>"Upon your stage, you move.</i>


00:26:15.965 --> 00:26:18.620
<i>"Out here, the chains are thick.</i>


00:26:18.664 --> 00:26:22.668
<i>"Out here, the
ringmaster's sick.</i>


00:26:22.711 --> 00:26:27.020
<i>Those gray bars in your way
are so ill-fitting, so..."</i>


00:26:28.630 --> 00:26:30.240
<i>I always had a sense</i>


00:26:30.284 --> 00:26:32.547
<i>that Rose might
try to come back.</i>


00:26:33.896 --> 00:26:36.986
<i>She had the guts to
stand up to anyone.</i>


00:26:38.161 --> 00:26:40.468
<i>Even my brother Knuckles.</i>


00:26:42.339 --> 00:26:45.386
<i>He tried to kill her once.</i>


00:26:45.429 --> 00:26:48.041
<i>But I interfered
because I love her.</i>


00:26:50.913 --> 00:26:54.177
<i>Even though she would never
look twice at a guy like me.</i>


00:26:57.006 --> 00:27:00.575
<i>Oh. He does look
cute in that sweater.</i>


00:27:00.619 --> 00:27:02.098
<i>I mean, look at him.</i>


00:27:02.142 --> 00:27:05.362
<i>He's kind, he's
smart, he is a badass.</i>


00:27:05.406 --> 00:27:11.673
<i>But he has to face his past
so we can get our lives back.</i>


00:27:14.720 --> 00:27:17.461
Consider this my
resignation, Marv.


00:27:18.549 --> 00:27:20.769
I just can't dance anymore.


00:27:39.266 --> 00:27:41.398
No one's ever...


00:27:45.011 --> 00:27:47.274
...understood my words before.


00:27:48.579 --> 00:27:49.798
Oh.


00:27:51.582 --> 00:27:54.020
No one's words


00:27:54.063 --> 00:27:58.502
have ever understood
me... before.


00:27:59.939 --> 00:28:02.550
Hey, Andi, you got the bar?


00:28:04.944 --> 00:28:06.162
Aw.


00:28:09.296 --> 00:28:12.560
Well, I really hate
that you shaved.


00:28:13.561 --> 00:28:14.780
You were the one...


00:28:14.823 --> 00:28:17.347
The glasses are a nice touch.


00:28:17.391 --> 00:28:18.827
Very Clark Kent.


00:28:27.227 --> 00:28:28.881
I got you out.


00:28:28.924 --> 00:28:30.578
What do you want, Rose?


00:28:30.621 --> 00:28:34.190
A secured outcome
no matter the cost.


00:28:34.234 --> 00:28:37.063
Exactly what outcome?


00:28:37.106 --> 00:28:39.413
I want my life back, and
I need you to help me.


00:28:39.456 --> 00:28:41.502
That's all.


00:28:42.677 --> 00:28:44.505
Your life back? Why now?


00:28:44.548 --> 00:28:47.203
Well, why not? It's
Valentine's Day.


00:28:47.247 --> 00:28:49.945
I sent the whole gang
these cute little cards.


00:28:49.989 --> 00:28:51.642
I learned calligraphy
and everything.


00:28:52.861 --> 00:28:55.255
Do you think this is a joke?


00:28:55.298 --> 00:28:56.473
We're in danger.


00:28:56.517 --> 00:28:57.953
Okay, relax.


00:28:57.997 --> 00:29:01.087
This isn't Knuckles' territory.


00:29:01.130 --> 00:29:03.959
You are safe. We are safe.


00:29:04.003 --> 00:29:06.309
We're not safe anywhere.


00:29:06.353 --> 00:29:08.659
Do you have any idea
what you have done?


00:29:08.703 --> 00:29:10.705
You need to run. Tonight.


00:29:10.749 --> 00:29:13.012
Oh, because that's how you
deal with Knuckles, right?


00:29:13.055 --> 00:29:14.230
"Running away."


00:29:16.189 --> 00:29:19.105
I know exactly what I've done.


00:29:19.148 --> 00:29:22.586
And I know exactly
what I'm doing.


00:29:22.630 --> 00:29:24.806
Goodbye, Rose.


00:29:24.850 --> 00:29:26.895
Marvin, this is it.


00:29:28.288 --> 00:29:32.335
It's now... or never.


00:29:33.380 --> 00:29:35.164
And I need your help.


00:29:36.209 --> 00:29:38.080
Hey, hey, hey. I know you.


00:29:38.124 --> 00:29:39.212
- Excuse me.
- No, it's you.


00:29:42.868 --> 00:29:44.652
Your ads, man.


00:29:44.695 --> 00:29:46.219
Your fucking bench ads.


00:29:46.262 --> 00:29:47.979
I see your face everywhere I go!
-I'm so sorry.


00:29:48.003 --> 00:29:49.024
What the fuck are you doing?
-Sorry, everyone.


00:29:49.048 --> 00:29:50.745
I'll give you a ride.


00:29:50.789 --> 00:29:52.878
Uh, Andi, can you
give Reggie some ice?


00:29:59.972 --> 00:30:03.062
I was pleasantly surprised
to find this in your pocket.


00:30:04.193 --> 00:30:06.935
Amethyst.


00:30:06.979 --> 00:30:09.198
One of the best protections
against nightmares.


00:30:09.242 --> 00:30:11.374
I'm the one who gave it to you.


00:30:11.418 --> 00:30:12.985
Why'd you keep it?


00:30:14.203 --> 00:30:15.552
I'm the sentimental type.


00:30:15.596 --> 00:30:17.511
I know.


00:30:17.554 --> 00:30:19.252
I love that about you.


00:30:24.474 --> 00:30:27.086
Come on. Let's go.


00:30:47.584 --> 00:30:49.760
What was that?


00:30:49.804 --> 00:30:51.980
What? You are being paranoid.


00:30:56.637 --> 00:30:58.552
You saved my award.


00:30:58.595 --> 00:31:03.513
Well, yeah. I could barely
pry it out of your hands.


00:31:03.557 --> 00:31:04.950
Slow down, could you?


00:31:04.993 --> 00:31:07.517
Well, the Marvin I
know likes to go fast.


00:31:12.740 --> 00:31:14.524
Oops.


00:31:17.963 --> 00:31:19.616
- Rose?
- Mm-hmm?


00:31:19.660 --> 00:31:21.096
What the heck are you doing?


00:31:21.140 --> 00:31:23.011
I want to see the
real you, right now.


00:31:23.055 --> 00:31:25.318
This is the real me.
The other guy's gone.


00:31:25.361 --> 00:31:27.320
I buried him out in
the quarry with you.


00:31:27.363 --> 00:31:29.365
No, no, no. I saw you
in the bar, babes.


00:31:29.409 --> 00:31:30.889
You wanted to hurt that guy.


00:31:32.281 --> 00:31:34.022
Marvin, come out!


00:31:34.066 --> 00:31:36.044
- Please stop! Please stop!
- Come out wherever you are!


00:31:36.068 --> 00:31:38.113
Fucking stop!


00:31:49.342 --> 00:31:52.823
There he is.


00:31:56.349 --> 00:31:59.874
<i>"The fear I feel has
little to do with death,</i>


00:31:59.918 --> 00:32:01.397
"for we all die,


00:32:01.441 --> 00:32:05.097
and everything to
do with not living."


00:32:11.407 --> 00:32:13.322
Your observations?


00:32:15.281 --> 00:32:17.544
You...


00:32:17.587 --> 00:32:21.983
write about death a lot, um...


00:32:22.027 --> 00:32:23.376
and killing.


00:32:23.419 --> 00:32:25.900
It's who I am.


00:32:25.944 --> 00:32:27.815
It's what I know.


00:32:30.644 --> 00:32:32.559
Am I in danger?


00:32:33.908 --> 00:32:36.171
From me?


00:32:36.215 --> 00:32:37.694
No.


00:32:40.001 --> 00:32:41.698
I'm the one in danger.


00:32:41.742 --> 00:32:44.092
Of what?


00:32:48.923 --> 00:32:52.013
♪ All the gold in the world,
no, it don't mean much... ♪


00:32:53.058 --> 00:32:54.973
Falling.


00:32:55.016 --> 00:32:58.106
♪ All the shine of the crown
might be good for looking ♪


00:32:58.150 --> 00:33:00.195
♪ But when it all breaks down ♪


00:33:00.239 --> 00:33:02.981
♪ Oh, they ain't got
nothing on you... ♪


00:33:03.024 --> 00:33:04.678
It's one of my listings.


00:33:04.721 --> 00:33:07.811
Hope to sell it this week.


00:33:07.855 --> 00:33:11.380
♪ Like a lake down south
where we all hang out ♪


00:33:11.424 --> 00:33:13.948
♪ With the Texas barbecue ♪


00:33:13.992 --> 00:33:15.099
♪ Like the sound of a song... ♪


00:33:15.123 --> 00:33:16.646
Pull into the garage.


00:33:16.690 --> 00:33:19.649
♪ Laying down some
two-chord truth... ♪


00:33:23.653 --> 00:33:26.004
Yeah. Let's do this shit.


00:33:34.142 --> 00:33:36.101
Rose.


00:33:42.150 --> 00:33:45.023
I like it here.


00:33:45.066 --> 00:33:47.112
Feels good.


00:33:47.155 --> 00:33:50.593
It's got a great layout,
lots of space, good light.


00:33:53.770 --> 00:33:56.034
- What?
- Nothing.


00:33:59.037 --> 00:34:00.516
You're cute.


00:34:03.476 --> 00:34:05.739
There are rooms upstairs
if you're tired.


00:34:10.657 --> 00:34:13.225
What's your whole deal
with this thing anyway?


00:34:16.010 --> 00:34:17.577
After I left Knuckles,


00:34:17.620 --> 00:34:21.015
I honestly didn't think
I could be normal.


00:34:21.059 --> 00:34:22.712
This proves I can.


00:34:26.499 --> 00:34:28.631
I've changed, Rose.


00:34:28.675 --> 00:34:30.329
Mm.


00:34:30.372 --> 00:34:31.939
No, you haven't.


00:34:31.982 --> 00:34:34.376
You're just hiding.


00:34:34.420 --> 00:34:37.031
What are you doing,
Rose? Are you crazy?


00:34:37.075 --> 00:34:39.555
I didn't come here to hide.


00:34:39.599 --> 00:34:42.254
Hey, I worked hard
to get to where I am.


00:34:42.297 --> 00:34:45.518
And because of you, I lost
everything in one day.


00:34:45.561 --> 00:34:47.998
Oh, I know exactly how
that feels, Marvin.


00:34:48.042 --> 00:34:49.957
Exactly.


00:34:50.000 --> 00:34:53.526
Why couldn't you
just stay dead, Rose?


00:34:53.569 --> 00:34:56.006
Because it's humiliating.


00:34:56.050 --> 00:34:58.400
No name, no truth.


00:34:58.444 --> 00:34:59.619
You got nothing.


00:34:59.662 --> 00:35:00.968
You're nobody.


00:35:01.011 --> 00:35:02.796
I'm nobody.


00:35:02.839 --> 00:35:06.278
Hiding ain't living.


00:35:07.975 --> 00:35:11.326
But if you want to
live to see next week,


00:35:11.370 --> 00:35:15.809
you'll run far away and
never show your face again.


00:35:15.852 --> 00:35:18.855
Well, I already did that.


00:35:18.899 --> 00:35:22.032
Now I'm trying
something different.


00:35:22.076 --> 00:35:26.298
How far would you go
to get your life back?


00:35:28.430 --> 00:35:31.346
I already did.


00:35:31.390 --> 00:35:34.088
Follow me. I got to
show you something.


00:36:01.898 --> 00:36:05.554
"Look in the mirror, fuckface."


00:36:19.089 --> 00:36:21.614
Kippy.


00:36:21.657 --> 00:36:23.703
Why is Knuckles'
accountant in your trunk?


00:36:23.746 --> 00:36:26.009
It's all part of the plan.


00:36:26.053 --> 00:36:28.577
And where is his finger?


00:36:31.711 --> 00:36:33.626
Marvin, you are not listening.


00:36:33.669 --> 00:36:35.367
I told you I want my life back,


00:36:35.410 --> 00:36:37.020
and I'll do what
it fucking takes.


00:36:37.064 --> 00:36:38.848
Cutting off his finger, Rose?


00:36:38.892 --> 00:36:40.783
Do you realize what a
dangerous game you're playing?


00:36:40.807 --> 00:36:42.330
Look, I needed a fingerprint.


00:36:46.769 --> 00:36:50.120
Yes, I know.


00:36:53.689 --> 00:36:54.995
Look at that.


00:36:55.038 --> 00:36:57.258
It's his dental caps.


00:36:57.302 --> 00:36:59.042
I'll be needing those back.


00:37:00.653 --> 00:37:02.002
Hello, Marv.


00:37:02.045 --> 00:37:04.091
All right.


00:37:04.134 --> 00:37:07.094
Now I want to know
what you and Merlo got


00:37:07.137 --> 00:37:09.314
out of setting me up.


00:37:09.357 --> 00:37:13.361
Three years ago, I helped Merlo
steal four million dollars.


00:37:14.971 --> 00:37:17.713
Of that sweet Russian money.


00:37:17.757 --> 00:37:19.715
Money you...


00:37:21.326 --> 00:37:23.458
...were going to hide
by cooking the books


00:37:23.502 --> 00:37:25.678
so Knuckles would never miss it.


00:37:25.721 --> 00:37:28.985
Which, by the way, he didn't,
because you fools put it


00:37:29.029 --> 00:37:31.510
in the trunk of my
car for him to find.


00:37:33.033 --> 00:37:36.776
Now, I'm a smart girl.


00:37:36.819 --> 00:37:39.169
I can think of a few reasons


00:37:39.213 --> 00:37:41.476
why you'd want me
out of the picture.


00:37:44.262 --> 00:37:48.875
But why, why, why
risk being killed


00:37:48.918 --> 00:37:52.879
stealing money from Knuckles
just to give it all back to him?


00:37:52.922 --> 00:37:54.968
Now, that just


00:37:55.011 --> 00:37:58.667
doesn't make sense.


00:37:59.668 --> 00:38:01.409
That's easy.


00:38:01.453 --> 00:38:03.455
We had no intention
of keeping the money.


00:38:03.498 --> 00:38:07.197
Merlo wanted your position
as Knuckles' right hand.


00:38:07.241 --> 00:38:08.503
Oh.


00:38:08.547 --> 00:38:10.592
He was willing to risk it all,


00:38:10.636 --> 00:38:14.248
and the two million dollars in
the, in the boot of your car,


00:38:14.292 --> 00:38:16.468
well, that was enough to
put you six feet under.


00:38:19.949 --> 00:38:21.951
You said "two million."


00:38:24.693 --> 00:38:26.347
We stole four.


00:38:27.783 --> 00:38:31.439
So, pray tell,
where's the other two?


00:38:33.572 --> 00:38:37.053
Don't waste my time, Kippy. You
want to lose another finger?


00:38:37.097 --> 00:38:38.490
Okay, okay.


00:38:38.533 --> 00:38:40.274
Merlo has it.


00:38:40.318 --> 00:38:43.103
He paid me for fixing the
books and took the rest.


00:38:44.800 --> 00:38:46.149
Fucking Merlo.


00:38:47.586 --> 00:38:48.935
He set me up.


00:38:48.978 --> 00:38:51.633
Mm. Yeah, I think so, yeah.


00:38:51.677 --> 00:38:55.898
Framed me and kept the other
two million for himself.


00:38:58.814 --> 00:39:01.208
So, Marv.


00:39:03.993 --> 00:39:07.432
You did drive me to a quarry
and leave me for dead.


00:39:22.098 --> 00:39:25.145
<i>I made Knuckles a fortune</i>


00:39:25.188 --> 00:39:26.427
<i>laundering money
from the Russians,</i>


00:39:26.451 --> 00:39:28.409
<i>- but as you know, I wanted out.</i>
- Marvin?


00:39:28.453 --> 00:39:32.065
Stealing money with Merlo
was never a good idea.


00:39:32.108 --> 00:39:34.937
You don't have to do this.
We can still... Whoa!


00:39:34.981 --> 00:39:36.983
<i>Of course that
motherfucker framed me.</i>


00:39:38.637 --> 00:39:41.335
Rose Carlisle is dead.


00:39:41.379 --> 00:39:43.163
Don't come back.


00:39:43.206 --> 00:39:44.512
The rule of the company is:


00:39:44.556 --> 00:39:46.427
If you steal from
Knuckles, you die.


00:39:50.170 --> 00:39:51.867
<i>But you broke that rule.</i>


00:39:51.911 --> 00:39:53.260
Marv.


00:39:53.303 --> 00:39:55.131
<i>- And defied your brother.</i>
- No.


00:39:56.132 --> 00:39:57.917
And I'm so grateful.


00:40:03.618 --> 00:40:05.794
But I just got to ask:


00:40:05.838 --> 00:40:07.970
Did you know they
were setting me up?


00:40:13.846 --> 00:40:15.064
I didn't know, okay?


00:40:15.108 --> 00:40:17.632
You didn't know?
You didn't know?!


00:40:17.676 --> 00:40:20.983
I knew you were a thief,
I knew you were a liar,


00:40:21.027 --> 00:40:22.681
and I knew my brother
wanted you dead.


00:40:22.724 --> 00:40:25.814
Oh, so you just
volunteered for the job?


00:40:25.858 --> 00:40:27.468
Yeah.


00:40:30.253 --> 00:40:31.429
Listen.


00:40:32.647 --> 00:40:35.868
If I didn't do it,
someone else would have.


00:40:36.912 --> 00:40:39.132
You'd be gone.


00:40:41.047 --> 00:40:44.137
And I knew if I took the job,


00:40:44.180 --> 00:40:47.488
it was the only chance
I had to save you.


00:40:47.532 --> 00:40:50.360
I didn't want to imagine
a world without you.


00:40:58.107 --> 00:41:00.109
The Russians.


00:41:00.153 --> 00:41:02.242
She knows it all.


00:41:02.285 --> 00:41:04.244
Valentine's Day, right?


00:41:05.201 --> 00:41:07.116
It's not my fucking day.


00:41:22.654 --> 00:41:24.307
Motherfucker took a swing at me.


00:41:26.353 --> 00:41:27.615
Yeah.


00:41:27.659 --> 00:41:29.791
Uh, what the fuck is that?


00:41:29.835 --> 00:41:31.489
Got it for Cindy
for Valentine's.


00:41:31.532 --> 00:41:33.882
That's why we made
this fucking stop?


00:41:35.710 --> 00:41:38.365
Bruh, it's simple.


00:41:38.408 --> 00:41:41.716
Ain't no fake-ass,
made-in-Sri-Lanka teddy bear


00:41:41.760 --> 00:41:44.676
gon' help you get your
fucking wife back.


00:41:44.719 --> 00:41:47.896
Get your fucking mind
together, my boy.


00:41:47.940 --> 00:41:49.637
Oh.


00:41:49.681 --> 00:41:52.422
Give the motherfucker his
bear back, and let's go.


00:41:52.466 --> 00:41:55.338
We got to go clean
up after Merlo.


00:42:08.047 --> 00:42:10.136
Marvin?


00:42:10.179 --> 00:42:12.181
What in the hell?


00:42:13.705 --> 00:42:15.707
Marvin, you here?


00:42:15.750 --> 00:42:18.057
I'm here to pick up the car.


00:42:18.100 --> 00:42:20.102
Your front door's wide open.


00:42:24.542 --> 00:42:25.891
Oh, uh...


00:42:32.898 --> 00:42:34.160
Hi.


00:42:35.204 --> 00:42:36.292
I'm Alvin.


00:42:36.336 --> 00:42:38.512
My friends call me Knuckles.


00:42:38.556 --> 00:42:40.079
Cliff Cussick. Howdy.


00:42:40.122 --> 00:42:42.995
Ah. My brother's savior.


00:42:43.038 --> 00:42:44.842
You're the one he spends
Thanksgiving with now, right?


00:42:44.866 --> 00:42:46.215
Yeah.


00:42:46.259 --> 00:42:48.609
Yeah, Marvin comes
over at Thanksgiving.


00:42:48.653 --> 00:42:49.958
He's family.


00:42:50.002 --> 00:42:51.022
I'm sorry. You
have to forgive me.


00:42:51.046 --> 00:42:53.179
I'm a little, uh, surprised.


00:42:53.222 --> 00:42:56.486
Marvin never mentioned
that he had a... brother.


00:42:56.530 --> 00:42:58.358
Drink?


00:42:58.401 --> 00:42:59.533
Oh.


00:43:01.709 --> 00:43:03.493
You're not gonna have one?


00:43:03.537 --> 00:43:06.105
I still got a little bit left.


00:43:06.148 --> 00:43:07.889
No, thank you, kindly.


00:43:09.761 --> 00:43:11.414
Where-where is he?


00:43:11.458 --> 00:43:13.262
I mean, I haven't seen
Marvin since he left work,


00:43:13.286 --> 00:43:14.524
and he wasn't looking too good.


00:43:14.548 --> 00:43:17.333
- What a considerate boss.
- Yeah.


00:43:17.377 --> 00:43:20.249
He's family, I told
you. He's my brother.


00:43:23.644 --> 00:43:27.300
I got to be honest
with you, Cliff.


00:43:27.343 --> 00:43:32.131
It hurts my feelings that
Marvin never mentioned me.


00:43:32.174 --> 00:43:34.655
Oh, well, maybe he did.


00:43:34.699 --> 00:43:36.352
My memory's not
like it used to be.


00:43:36.396 --> 00:43:38.050
You want to feel better?


00:43:38.093 --> 00:43:39.878
Marvin never told me
he played baseball.


00:43:40.966 --> 00:43:43.229
Oh, I can assure you, Cliff,


00:43:43.272 --> 00:43:46.058
there's a lot Marvin
didn't tell you.


00:43:47.102 --> 00:43:48.756
<i>Rose is right.</i>


00:43:48.800 --> 00:43:50.410
<i>I am hiding.</i>


00:44:01.029 --> 00:44:02.988
<i>I allowed my brother to turn me</i>


00:44:03.031 --> 00:44:05.686
<i>into someone I
never wanted to be.</i>


00:44:05.730 --> 00:44:08.907
I could take you to at least a
dozen holes in the old quarry


00:44:08.950 --> 00:44:10.386
that Marvin filled with bodies.


00:44:13.781 --> 00:44:15.696
He was such a...


00:44:15.740 --> 00:44:17.567
beautiful, beautiful monster.


00:44:21.746 --> 00:44:23.095
But I controlled it.


00:44:23.138 --> 00:44:26.141
He was obedient, did
what I said, always.


00:44:27.142 --> 00:44:28.578
And when I unleashed him...


00:44:28.622 --> 00:44:30.624
Oh.


00:44:34.149 --> 00:44:35.847
I could take you
to the last hole.


00:44:37.762 --> 00:44:40.329
But all you'd find is a hole.


00:44:40.373 --> 00:44:43.463
'Cause apparently, he fell in
love and found a conscience.


00:44:45.247 --> 00:44:47.336
Ever see her around?


00:44:48.337 --> 00:44:50.513
No, sir, I don't believe I have.


00:44:50.557 --> 00:44:53.255
You sure?


00:44:53.299 --> 00:44:56.519
She seems like the kind of
woman a man would remember.


00:44:59.218 --> 00:45:00.828
<i>I don't know if
Marvin understands</i>


00:45:00.872 --> 00:45:03.396
<i>I'm here to save him.</i>


00:45:03.439 --> 00:45:05.659
<i>Just like he saved me.</i>


00:45:07.313 --> 00:45:11.360
<i>We have to face Knuckles
to be truly free, and...</i>


00:45:11.404 --> 00:45:13.928
<i>I don't want to
do it without him.</i>


00:45:18.846 --> 00:45:20.848
Goddamn, Alvin.


00:45:21.936 --> 00:45:23.677
Those are some big words.


00:45:24.634 --> 00:45:27.942
I got to be honest. I, uh...


00:45:27.986 --> 00:45:30.945
I don't know that much about
the world you're talking about.


00:45:32.991 --> 00:45:34.644
But I'm not naive enough to know


00:45:34.688 --> 00:45:36.448
there's gonna be anything I
can say in this room right now


00:45:36.472 --> 00:45:40.259
that's gonna change my fate.


00:45:40.302 --> 00:45:42.261
I'll tell you what.


00:45:43.436 --> 00:45:45.655
I believe in absolution.


00:45:47.701 --> 00:45:49.659
I believe in second chances.


00:45:51.096 --> 00:45:55.535
The difference between
putting bodies in holes


00:45:55.578 --> 00:45:57.755
and families in homes...


00:45:59.104 --> 00:46:00.409
...is pretty big.


00:46:01.410 --> 00:46:03.064
Maybe too big.


00:46:05.066 --> 00:46:06.720
<i>Knuckles only set me free</i>


00:46:06.764 --> 00:46:09.549
<i>because I promised to kill Rose.</i>


00:46:11.203 --> 00:46:15.947
<i>Now he will never
stop hunting us.</i>


00:46:15.990 --> 00:46:20.212
<i>I know I have to face my
past to be truly free.</i>


00:46:22.910 --> 00:46:25.739
<i>But goddamn it,</i>


00:46:25.783 --> 00:46:28.437
<i>I love this new life.</i>


00:46:28.481 --> 00:46:31.876
From the minute he started
selling homes for me,


00:46:31.919 --> 00:46:35.009
he was working like he was
making up for something.


00:46:38.970 --> 00:46:40.798
You know what?


00:46:40.841 --> 00:46:42.843
Think I will take that drink.


00:46:53.636 --> 00:46:56.596
And when push comes to shove,


00:46:56.639 --> 00:46:59.207
Marvin's gonna be all right.


00:46:59.251 --> 00:47:01.253
You're a wise man, Cliff.


00:47:03.255 --> 00:47:04.604
But...


00:47:04.647 --> 00:47:07.737
Marvin only has one brother.


00:47:28.280 --> 00:47:29.803
Oh.


00:47:29.847 --> 00:47:31.457
Morning, Marv.


00:47:33.589 --> 00:47:35.678
- Painkillers.
- Oh.


00:47:36.854 --> 00:47:38.029
Mm-hmm.


00:47:40.727 --> 00:47:42.337
Oh, yeah.


00:47:42.381 --> 00:47:44.035
I appreciate that.


00:47:44.078 --> 00:47:45.732
I got to say,


00:47:45.775 --> 00:47:47.735
a lot of intrigue with
this whole money situation.


00:47:48.691 --> 00:47:50.519
Proper fucking quagmire.


00:48:04.446 --> 00:48:06.274
Merlo and I thought
we were real smart


00:48:06.318 --> 00:48:08.015
when we set up Rose
the way we did.


00:48:09.103 --> 00:48:10.626
Knuckles still doesn't know


00:48:10.670 --> 00:48:13.455
<i>we stole more than what
he found in Rose's trunk.</i>


00:48:13.499 --> 00:48:14.935
<i>But you know the rule:</i>


00:48:14.979 --> 00:48:18.373
<i>If you steal from
Knuckles, you die.</i>


00:48:20.767 --> 00:48:22.769
Fuck me, man.


00:48:22.812 --> 00:48:24.379
I would not like to be you


00:48:24.423 --> 00:48:26.860
when your brother
finds out Rose is here.


00:48:28.949 --> 00:48:30.733
Finds out?


00:48:30.777 --> 00:48:32.431
Not that he will.


00:48:32.474 --> 00:48:33.911
I mean, I won't say anything.


00:48:33.954 --> 00:48:35.173
No.


00:48:36.826 --> 00:48:38.089
But I tell you what.


00:48:38.132 --> 00:48:40.221
A little bit of hush money


00:48:40.265 --> 00:48:42.745
might just put both
of our minds at ease.


00:49:04.419 --> 00:49:06.813
Why are you shutting the doors?


00:49:06.856 --> 00:49:08.858
You know what I used to
do for my brother, right?


00:49:10.034 --> 00:49:12.253
My job.


00:49:12.297 --> 00:49:14.516
Yeah, of course. Everyone knew.


00:49:14.560 --> 00:49:17.563
But you don't do that anymore.


00:49:20.131 --> 00:49:24.178
Well, Kippy, you're not
giving me much of a choice.


00:49:34.928 --> 00:49:36.974
Oh, fuck.


00:49:42.327 --> 00:49:43.763
It's the Reebers.


00:49:43.806 --> 00:49:45.069
Marvin?


00:49:47.375 --> 00:49:48.942
Don't open that door.


00:49:52.946 --> 00:49:55.775
Please. I love this life.


00:49:58.821 --> 00:50:01.041
Hiding ain't living.


00:50:06.090 --> 00:50:08.396
- Morning, Marvin!
- Oh, morning, Marvin!


00:50:08.440 --> 00:50:10.760
- Chet, Sherry, good morning.
- Hi. -CHET: Oh, my goodness.


00:50:10.790 --> 00:50:12.661
What happened to your hand there, buddy?
-


00:50:12.705 --> 00:50:14.663
Uh, I'm fine. Bike accident.


00:50:14.707 --> 00:50:16.361
Have you made a decision?


00:50:16.404 --> 00:50:17.753
Well, we thought
about it, and...


00:50:17.797 --> 00:50:19.451
- Here, hold my hand.
- Of course.


00:50:21.148 --> 00:50:23.803
We want this home from you!


00:50:23.846 --> 00:50:26.110
- Living room.
- Living room. Okay, great.


00:50:28.590 --> 00:50:31.506
Oh. Every time.
It's so welcoming.


00:50:31.550 --> 00:50:33.117
"[playing quietly]


00:50:36.337 --> 00:50:37.773
Marv.


00:50:37.817 --> 00:50:38.861
It's me.


00:50:38.905 --> 00:50:40.472
Yeah, I know. Uh, where are you?


00:50:40.515 --> 00:50:42.169
What is going on? Are you okay?


00:50:42.213 --> 00:50:43.475
I'm fine. Listen.


00:50:43.518 --> 00:50:45.781
Um, did you, did
you get my message?


00:50:45.825 --> 00:50:47.174
No. Why?


00:50:47.218 --> 00:50:50.699
Um, I just... I quit, is all.


00:50:50.743 --> 00:50:52.266
Again?


00:50:52.310 --> 00:50:53.765
- I'm not happy.
- Marvin, look. It's you!


00:50:53.789 --> 00:50:55.791
I need a change, Marv.


00:50:55.835 --> 00:50:57.184
Can you quit later?


00:50:57.228 --> 00:50:58.620
I need you to
bring me the papers


00:50:58.664 --> 00:51:00.405
to the Emerald Springs house.


00:51:01.884 --> 00:51:02.972
R-Right now?


00:51:03.016 --> 00:51:05.540
Yes, right now.


00:51:05.584 --> 00:51:08.195
The Reebers are here,
and they want to buy.


00:51:08.239 --> 00:51:10.284
Yeah. Um, I just...


00:51:10.328 --> 00:51:13.592
I don't think that I should.


00:51:13.635 --> 00:51:16.682
Ashley, it's important.


00:51:19.032 --> 00:51:21.382
Fine. Fine, fine,
fine, fine, fine.


00:51:21.426 --> 00:51:23.254
Fine, fine, fine, fuck, fuck.


00:51:23.297 --> 00:51:26.257
- Where is he?
- Shit!


00:51:28.259 --> 00:51:29.564
Chet?


00:51:35.135 --> 00:51:38.704
Are these the new
energy efficient models?


00:51:39.879 --> 00:51:41.272
Uh...


00:51:42.838 --> 00:51:44.231
Yes.


00:51:44.275 --> 00:51:45.885
Aren't they great?


00:51:45.928 --> 00:51:46.992
They're gorgeous.
They're perfect.


00:51:47.016 --> 00:51:48.017
You know what?


00:51:48.061 --> 00:51:49.758
I'm just not sold on this chair.


00:51:49.802 --> 00:51:51.238
I found your brother.


00:51:51.282 --> 00:51:52.587
Is Rose with him?


00:51:52.631 --> 00:51:54.459
I don't know. I'm on my way.


00:51:54.502 --> 00:51:56.635
Be as hard on him
as you need to be,


00:51:56.678 --> 00:51:58.202
but I want them both alive.


00:52:02.510 --> 00:52:04.947
I... I need you to stay.


00:52:05.905 --> 00:52:07.472
Forever.


00:52:09.648 --> 00:52:10.866
If it were that easy.


00:52:12.781 --> 00:52:14.696
Please. Stay here with me.


00:52:14.740 --> 00:52:17.264
I know that out there
is all the-the death


00:52:17.308 --> 00:52:19.397
and the killing that
you write about,


00:52:19.440 --> 00:52:23.314
but in here, you can be
who I know you really are.


00:52:23.357 --> 00:52:24.967
And we can be whatever
we want to be.


00:52:25.011 --> 00:52:27.274
We-we... we can be
poets, we can be artists,


00:52:27.318 --> 00:52:28.754
we can be creators.


00:52:32.105 --> 00:52:33.802
I don't have a choice.


00:52:33.846 --> 00:52:35.891
Fine, neither do I.


00:52:35.935 --> 00:52:38.285
So I am...


00:52:38.329 --> 00:52:41.158
I'm coming with you.
Hold... Stop walking fast.


00:52:41.201 --> 00:52:42.637
What do you want?


00:52:42.681 --> 00:52:44.204
Hey, boss. How you doing?


00:52:44.248 --> 00:52:45.684
Just get back to LKP.


00:52:45.727 --> 00:52:47.009
I need someone there
when The Raven shows up.


00:52:47.033 --> 00:52:48.556
He found Marvin and maybe Rose.


00:52:48.600 --> 00:52:49.862
Okay, okay.


00:52:49.905 --> 00:52:51.255
Why don't I just call The Raven,


00:52:51.298 --> 00:52:52.618
and I'll get the
details myself...


00:52:52.647 --> 00:52:54.083
Did I fucking stutter?!


00:52:54.127 --> 00:52:56.260
The Raven already did your job.


00:52:56.303 --> 00:52:58.087
But listen...


00:53:01.700 --> 00:53:03.267
Hey!


